This repository holds several packages, one per folder. Each folder has its own LICENSE, and there is no licence
for the repository as a whole.

  clap/     MIT
  mert/     CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial only; it contains a copy of the MERT model code, see mert/NOTICE)
  siglip/   MIT
  wavlm/    MIT
  whisper/  MIT

The models these packages download have their own terms; each package's README and the `credits` of its views say
which.
